item.description:
Having captured the weapons researcher DOCTOR ZELDRIN and discovered that the EMPIRE was holding him to research a new superweapon, the crew have to escape a base on alert, while destroying all the research stored on site. An army of STORMTROOPERS stands between them and escape, but first they have to collect their droids, as well as a very sleepy scientist.<br />
<br />
&nbsp;

