item.description:
It has been six months since the rise of the GALACTIC EMPIRE and the devastation of the JEDI ORDER. With Karrell taking the KRALLET’S FANG and her cargo of padawans out into WILD SPACE, those that have stayed behind are living in close quarters aboard the SOCIAL DETOX. As work and credits grow scarce and the EMPIRE consolidates its grasp, Tazi, Quinth, Zhaan, A-1 and D4 need to find a way to survive without their friend, and the ship that they called home...<br />
<br />
&nbsp;

item.itunes:summary:
It has been six months since the rise of the GALACTIC EMPIRE and the devastation of the JEDI ORDER. With Karrell taking the KRALLET’S FANG and her cargo of padawans out into WILD SPACE, those that have stayed behind are living in close quarters aboard the SOCIAL DETOX. As work and credits grow scarce and the EMPIRE consolidates its grasp, Tazi, Quinth, Zhaan, A-1 and D4 need to find a way to survive without their friend, and the ship that they called home...<br />
<br />
&nbsp;

item.description:
Having safely arrived back on CORUSCANT, the crew split up to take care of some tasks. Tazi and Quinth set off to recover the KRALLET’S FANG from storage and discuss their future, while A-1, D4 and Zhaan lounge in the Firespray. Meanwhile, Karrell heads into the temple to report, not knowing that the DARK SIDE is about to engulf them all into it’s power-hungry plans…<br />
<br />
&nbsp;

