<br />
&nbsp;

item.description:
Having some time off from Jedi-business, Tazi lands the ship an easy-money job ferrying a couple of beings to a planet in the outer rim. With extra supplies laid in, they hopefully won’t run out of food, but when a dinner party turns to oversharing, the crew will have plenty on their plates other than Noodles three times.<br />
<br />
&nbsp;

