item.description:
Mixed emotions, mixed signals and burnt cookies are the least of the problems for the crew as Tazi leaves the ship and storms off alone into the seedy underbelly of CANTO BIGHT. How will Isla and A-1 get the prickly pair back on track when there are gamblers to kidnap, and plans to finalize?<br />
<br />
&nbsp;

