<br />
&nbsp;

item.description:
With Tazi holed up in the suite at the top of the resort on CANTO BIGHT dealing with a disapproving tailor, Karrell and Isla go to find their own outfits to better blend in with the high-rollers and well to do of this decadent resort town. Unseen by the distracted crew, there are still beings following their every move, documenting them for some yet-unknown purpose….<br />
<br />
&nbsp;

