item.description:
A hurried repair and a quick exit from the REPUBLIC FLEET starts the crew on their way back to the JEDI TEMPLE so Karrell can report in. However, poor craftsmanship and a rushed mindset means that plans tend to change rather abruptly for the crew, when it’s least expected.<br />
<br />
&nbsp;

