item.description:
In this episode, our own GM Chris and Billy (former guest star and voice of Kazi and the Jedi Knight Keta) from the <a href="http://www.fandible.com/soloshot/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Fandible Soloshot</a> Podcast discuss the mysticism that is called THE FORCE.<br />
<br />
&nbsp;

